    {
      "id": "writes-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1930,
      "width": 798.5,
      "height": 261.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172033",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 48,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 58,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791927385490,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Example: a node receives a new importance vote.\n\u2022 Its ranking or vote statistics may change, so PageVersion increases (for example, 7 to 8).\n\u2022 The next read asks for version 8. A cached page keyed with version 7 does not match.\n\u2022 The read builds a fresh ranked page; unchanged display cards can still be reused.\n\nChanges to titles, content, parent links, visibility, reactions or comments advance both versions.\n\u2022 DetailVersion changes too, so old card text and breadcrumb segments are not reused.\n\u2022 Row changes and revision increments commit together. A rollback undoes both.\n\nThe old entries can remain in memory until expiry or eviction; new reads do not select them.\nThe 30-second expiry limits retention. Revision checks prevent reuse immediately after commit.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Example: a node receives a new importance vote.\n\u2022 Its ranking or vote statistics may change, so PageVersion increases (for example, 7 to 8).\n\u2022 The next read asks for version 8. A cached page keyed with version 7 does not match.\n\u2022 The read builds a fresh ranked page; unchanged display cards can still be reused.\n\nChanges to titles, content, parent links, visibility, reactions or comments advance both versions.\n\u2022 DetailVersion changes too, so old card text and breadcrumb segments are not reused.\n\u2022 Row changes and revision increments commit together. A rollback undoes both.\n\nThe old entries can remain in memory until expiry or eviction; new reads do not select them.\nThe 30-second expiry limits retention. Revision checks prevent reuse immediately after commit.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "reads-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2250,
      "width": 1065.140625,
      "height": 71.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172033",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 49,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 58,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791927385490,
      "link": "https://github.com/williamowen65/atlas-the-public-think-tank/blob/PTT-132-discovery-read-query/docs/blackboards/workflows/Discovery/DiscoveryReadFlow.md",
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Read budget: root cold/new page = 6; deep cold \u22648; fully cached = 1 revision read; filter change with reused cards = 3.\nBreadcrumb pages read \u22643 ancestors; follow a selected route toward the root. No per-card repository calls.\nOpen the linked source from each box, or follow DiscoveryReadFlow.md for a method-by-method walkthrough.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Read budget: root cold/new page = 6; deep cold \u22648; fully cached = 1 revision read; filter change with reused cards = 3.\nBreadcrumb pages read \u22643 ancestors; follow a selected route toward the root. No per-card repository calls.\nOpen the linked source from each box, or follow DiscoveryReadFlow.md for a method-by-method walkthrough.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
